{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 高性能網站建設指南\nHigh Performance Web Sites — Steve Souders",
      "x": -160,
      "y": -50,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🥇 黃金法則：前端優先",
      "x": 300,
      "y": -840,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -1015,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-前端效能優化規則.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -865,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**80–90% 的使用者等待時間發生在前端**\n優化前端的投報率遠高於優化後端"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-l3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -715,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**先量測再優化**\n用開發者工具／效能瀑布圖找出真正的瓶頸資源"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "📉 減少 HTTP 請求",
      "x": 300,
      "y": -350,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -525,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**合併檔案**\n多支 JS／CSS 合併成一支，減少往返次數"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -375,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**CSS Sprites**\n把多張小圖併成一張，用背景位移取用"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2-l3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -225,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**行內小資源**\n極小的圖／樣式直接 inline，省掉一次請求"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "🗄 快取與 CDN",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 215,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": -35,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-快取與資源優化.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 115,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**加 Expires／Cache-Control 標頭**\n讓重複造訪直接用本地副本，不再重抓"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-l3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 265,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**內容雜湊檔名（cache busting）**\n`app.9f3c.js`：可放心永久快取，更新自動失效"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3-l4",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 415,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**使用 CDN**\n靜態資源就近提供，降低網路延遲"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "📦 壓縮與資源擺放位置",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4-l1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 605,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Gzip 壓縮傳輸內容**\n文字類資源壓縮後體積大幅下降"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4-l2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 755,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**CSS 放頁面頂部**\n讓瀏覽器盡早開始漸進渲染，避免白畫面"
    },
    {
      "id": "c4-l3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 905,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**JS 放頁面底部**\n腳本下載與執行會阻塞渲染，往後擺"
    }
  ],
